## Setup and Execution

**Current status:** Initial development environment setup and LLM API experimentation are in progress.

The planned setup will include:

1. Install Python and the required development tools.
2. Clone the GitHub repository.
3. Create and activate a Python virtual environment.
4. Install the required project dependencies.
5. Configure the LLM API securely using environment variables.
6. Implement the Prompt Engineering approach.
7. Develop the RAG-based customer support system.
8. Explore and implement the Fine-Tuning approach.
9. Execute test cases and compare the results.

Detailed installation instructions, execution commands, and configuration details will be added and verified as development progresses.

**Note:** API keys and other sensitive credentials must not be uploaded to GitHub.

