## Project Objectives

- Study and understand Prompt Engineering, RAG, and Fine-Tuning.
- Develop a customer support automation system using Generative AI.
- Implement a Prompt Engineering-based response generation approach.
- Develop a RAG-based system for retrieving relevant customer support information.
- Explore Fine-Tuning for adapting language models to customer support tasks.
- Compare the three approaches using common customer support queries.
- Evaluate response accuracy, relevance, response time, and reliability.
- Identify the advantages, limitations, and suitable applications of each approach.
- Document the implementation process, experiments, and evaluation results.

